# LaTeX build artifacts. thesis_v9.pdf is deliberately NOT listed -- the built
# PDF is the deliverable and is tracked.
#
# A truncated .aux/.out from an interrupted run causes
# "File ended while scanning use of \@newl@bel"; fix with `latexmk -C`, not by
# hand-editing these.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
